        <source>Showing the first {0} of {1} instruments. Filter to narrow the list.</source>
        <target state="translated">전체 계측 {1}개 중 첫 {0}개를 표시합니다. 목록을 좁히려면 필터를 적용하세요.</target>
        <note>{0} is the number of instruments shown, {1} is the number of instruments in the list.</note>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="MetricsInstrumentNoDataTooltip">
        <source>No data has been recorded for this instrument yet</source>
        <target state="translated">이 계측에 아직 기록된 데이터가 없음</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="MetricsInstrumentTypeCounter">
        <source>Counter</source>
        <target state="translated">카운터</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="MetricsInstrumentTypeGauge">
        <source>Gauge</source>
        <target state="translated">계기</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
