        <source>Meter</source>
        <target state="translated">미터</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="MetricsOrganizeResource">
        <source>Resource</source>
        <target state="translated">리소스</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="MetricsOverviewNoData">
        <source>No data</source>
        <target state="translated">데이터 없음</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="MetricsPageTitle">
        <source>{0} metrics</source>
        <target state="translated">{0} 메트릭</target>
        <note>{0} is an application name</note>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="MetricsPinInstrument">
        <source>Pin metric</source>
        <target state="translated">메트릭 고정</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="MetricsPinLimitReached">
        <source>Can't pin this metric. The limit is {0} pins per application. Select fewer resources or unpin existing metrics.</source>
        <target state="translated">이 메트릭을 고정할 수 없습니다. 애플리케이션당 최대 {0}개의 핀을 사용할 수 있습니다. 리소스를 더 적게 선택하거나 기존 메트릭의 고정을 해제하세요.</target>
        <note>{0} is the maximum number of saved metric pins.</note>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="MetricsPinnedEmpty">
        <source>No pinned metrics for this resource. Pin a metric from its card or chart to see it here.</source>
        <target state="translated">이 리소스에 고정된 메트릭이 없습니다. 여기에서 보려면 메트릭 카드나 차트에서 메트릭을 고정하세요.</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="MetricsPinnedHeader">
        <source>Pinned</source>
        <target state="translated">고정됨</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="MetricsSelectAResource">
        <source>Select a resource to view metrics</source>
        <target state="translated">메트릭을 볼 리소스 선택</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="MetricsSelectInstrument">
